## Rules

- **Never** put LLM calls directly in a route handler — always delegate to an agent or service class
- **Always** validate LLM output with Zod before using it
- **Always** implement retry + graceful shutdown in production agents
- **Never** hardcode model names — use `models.config.ts`
- **Always** log structured JSON, never raw strings
- **Prefer** class-based agents over ad-hoc async functions for anything that runs in a loop
- **Always** separate tool definitions from agent logic
- **Orchestrators coordinate, subagents execute** — subagents never call each other directly
- **Use MCP** for any tool set you want to share across agents or expose to Claude/Cursor
- **Stream when possible** — never block on full completion for user-facing output
- Use `pm2` with `ecosystem.config.js` for all production agent processes
